1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
When I first came here,

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,960
We had no shared understanding.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:10,080
Whatever you were discussing, I
was completely outside it.

4
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:13,840
I did not know what you were
doing. I had no way to connect
with you.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:16,867
I could not contribute anything. I
could only watch.

6
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,360
Then why did you not ask?

7
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,760
How could I ask? I did not even
know

8
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:25,280
what he meant by experience. I had
no idea what any of it was.

9
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,013
I did not know what we were
dealing with.

10
00:00:27,013 --> 00:00:29,213
What should I say? I do not know
where to begin.

11
00:00:29,213 --> 00:00:31,293
But you’re speaking now.

12
00:00:32,773 --> 00:00:35,493
He Fa kept asking me to speak. I
did not know what to say.

13
00:00:35,493 --> 00:00:39,133
All I could say was: ask me
something, and then I can answer.

14
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:41,733
That’s why we interact. It got you
talking.

15
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:46,813
First, someone needs to tell me
where each of you is coming from.

16
00:00:46,813 --> 00:00:50,733
Then I can explain where I am
coming from. After that, we can
develop together.

17
00:00:50,747 --> 00:00:53,867
There was no single designated
director.

18
00:00:53,867 --> 00:00:55,147
We direct each other.

19
00:00:55,147 --> 00:00:59,387
Then we need to share our methods.

20
00:00:59,387 --> 00:01:01,747
You offer your instincts to each
other.

21
00:01:01,747 --> 00:01:05,867
Maybe we have instincts, but no
methods to share.

22
00:01:05,867 --> 00:01:07,187
Yes.

23
00:01:07,727 --> 00:01:08,847
Is that the problem?
